Build the API with Spring Boot 4 (Java 21, Maven) and the frontend with Vue (TypeScript, built with Vite). The backend serves the API and the frontend build. Store data in SQLite under `./data`.
The backend is a Maven project in `backend/` (`backend/pom.xml`, sources in `backend/src/main/java/`). The frontend is a Vite project in `frontend/`; `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`.
